board: U-BOARD-1 rev A
supply: +3V3 = 3.3 V
LEDs:
  D1 via R1 (330 ohm) on PA5: lights when PA5 is HIGH (active-high, the pin sources current)
      current = (3.3 V - 2 V) / 330 ohm = 3.9 mA
  D2 via R3 (470 ohm) on PB0: lights when PB0 is LOW (active-low, the pin sinks current)
      current = (3.3 V - 2 V) / 470 ohm = 2.8 mA
buttons:
  SW1 on PC13: pressed connects it to GND, so pressed reads LOW (active-low); board pull: up (R2); firmware pull: none
decoupling:
  2 VDD pins on U1, 2 fitted capacitors on +3V3  ok
problems found: 0
